<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: It was a fortuitous find: The tribe's foragers were out gathering berries when they spotted a strange metal building half-sunken into the earth, its walls threaded with coiling tubes like the veins of some sleeping giant. Was it crafted by ancient hands, or shaped by the gods themselves? We soon learned it must be divine. Offerings placed within the "pneumatic nexus" vanished with a holy whoosh, only to return later as transformed gifts.\n\nNote: You'll start poor and lack technology, but having the pneumatic nexus means this start is easier than a standard tribal one.-->
  <VQEA_CargoCult.description>这是一个偶然的发现：部落的采集者外出采摘浆果时，发现了一座半沉入地下的奇怪金属建筑，其墙壁上布满了盘绕的管子，就像某个沉睡巨人的静脉一样。它是出自远古之手，还是神灵亲自塑造的？我们很快就知道它一定是神圣的。放置在“气动联系”中的祭品随着一声神圣的嗖嗖声消失了，之后又以转化后的礼物的形式返回。

注意：你一开始会很穷，缺乏技术，但拥有气动联系意味着这个开始比标准的部落更容易。</VQEA_CargoCult.description>
  <!--EN: Cargo Cult-->
  <VQEA_CargoCult.label>货物崇拜</VQEA_CargoCult.label>
  <!--EN: It was a fortuitous find: The tribe's foragers were out gathering berries when they spotted a strange metal building half-sunken into the earth, its walls threaded with coiling tubes like the veins of some sleeping giant. Was it crafted by ancient hands, or shaped by the gods themselves? We soon learned it must be divine. Offerings placed within the "pneumatic nexus" vanished with a holy whoosh, only to return later as transformed gifts.-->
  <VQEA_CargoCult.scenario.parts.11.text>这是一个偶然的发现：部落的采集者外出采摘浆果时，发现了一座半沉入地下的奇怪金属建筑，其墙壁上布满了盘绕的管子，就像某个沉睡巨人的静脉一样。它是出自远古之手，还是神灵亲自塑造的？我们很快就知道它一定是神圣的。放置在“气动连接”中的祭品随着一声神圣的嗖嗖声消失了，只是后来以变形的礼物形式返回。</VQEA_CargoCult.scenario.parts.11.text>
  <!--EN: Five lost tribespeople stumble upon a pneumatic nexus and start revering it. Moderate-High difficulty.-->
  <VQEA_CargoCult.scenario.summary>五名失落的部落居民偶然发现了一种气动联系并开始崇敬它。中高难度。</VQEA_CargoCult.scenario.summary>
  <!--EN: A memory drifts into your fractured mind as you stumble into a rusted chamber. An experiment, a group of doctors wearing abstract masks, and a flash of golden yellow light enveloping your body. You feel something deeply unnatural pulsing in your chest, you have been modified somehow and have been sleeping for a very long time. Your legs shake as you remember what this place is, a near impenetrable fortress capable of keeping rescue out and captives in. The vault contains an underground section guarded by a sealed door. After so many years, your captives appear long gone. The cold realization thuds onto your chest, what unknown force may have placed you back here?-->
  <VQE_NewVault.description>当你跌跌撞撞地走进一个生锈的房间时，一段记忆飘进了你破碎的心灵。一场实验，一群戴着抽象面具的医生，一道金黄色的光芒笼罩着你的身体。你感觉到胸口有一种非常不自然的脉动，你已经被某种方式改变了，而且已经睡了很长时间了。当你想起这个地方是什么时，你的双腿发抖，一座几乎坚不可摧的堡垒，能够将救援人员拒之门外，将俘虏拒之门外。金库包含一个由密封门守卫的地下部分。这么多年过去了，你的俘虏似乎早已消失了。冰冷的认知猛然袭上你的胸口，到底是什么未知的力量让你回到了这里？</VQE_NewVault.description>
  <!--EN: Sealed Vault-->
  <VQE_NewVault.label>密封金库</VQE_NewVault.label>
  <!--EN: A memory drifts into your fractured mind as you stumble into a rusted chamber. An experiment, a group of doctors wearing abstract masks, and a flash of golden yellow light enveloping your body. You feel something deeply unnatural pulsing in your chest, you have been modified somehow and have been sleeping for a very long time. Your legs shake as you remember what this place is, a near impenetrable fortress capable of keeping rescue out and captives in. The vault contains an underground section guarded by a sealed door. After so many years, your captives appear long gone. The cold realization thuds onto your chest, what unknown force may have placed you back here?-->
  <VQE_NewVault.scenario.parts.9.text>当你跌跌撞撞地走进一个生锈的房间时，一段记忆飘进了你破碎的心灵。一场实验，一群戴着抽象面具的医生，一道金黄色的光芒笼罩着你的身体。你感觉到胸口有一种非常不自然的脉动，你已经被某种方式改变了，而且已经睡了很长时间了。当你想起这个地方是什么时，你的双腿发抖，一座几乎坚不可摧的堡垒，能够将救援人员拒之门外，将俘虏拒之门外。金库包含一个由密封门守卫的地下部分。这么多年过去了，你的俘虏似乎早已消失了。冰冷的认知猛然袭上你的胸口，到底是什么未知的力量让你回到了这里？</VQE_NewVault.scenario.parts.9.text>
  <!--EN: A long forgotten supersoldier guarding their post. A classic VQE - Ancients experience.-->
  <VQE_NewVault.scenario.summary>一位早已被遗忘的超级士兵守卫着自己的岗位。经典的 VQE - 古代体验。</VQE_NewVault.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
